# Where an isolated named desktop keeps each store that matters, one per line.
#
#   <verdict> <path relative to the home>
#
# local   kept per-machine, in the desktop's own directory (HDW4S_LOCAL_DATA)
#         instead of at this path in the shared home. Each has its own mechanism;
#         this list names them, it does not move anything.
# shared  stays in the shared home, on purpose: it is the person's data and must
#         follow them. Two machines running the same program at once share it the
#         way any two machines sharing a home do.
# noted   stays in the shared home, but is known to misbehave there when used
#         from two machines; reported, never moved.
#
# Installed to /usr/share/hdw4s/shared-stores. Lines in /etc/hdw4s/shared-stores
# are added to these and cannot remove one. A store on neither list is reported
# when it is found being written (it is not prevented).
local  .local/share/keyrings
local  .local/share/firefox
local  .local/share/thunderbird
shared .local/share/evolution
shared .local/share/shotwell
shared .local/share/gnome-shell
shared .local/share/recently-used.xbel
shared .local/share/gvfs-metadata
shared .local/share/applications
shared .local/share/icons
shared .local/share/fonts
shared .local/share/sounds
shared .local/share/backgrounds
shared .local/share/mime
shared .local/share/nautilus
shared .local/share/Trash
noted  .local/share/containers
noted  .local/share/docker
noted  .local/share/libvirt
noted  .local/share/gnome-boxes
